    "jobDescription": "<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Job Description</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM Application Developer</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Experience:</strong> 7–10 Years<br><strong>Location:</strong> Bangalore, India<br><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Full-Time</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Role Overview</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">At Ralliant, we are looking for an experienced Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM Application Developer with 7–10 years of hands-on experience in designing, developing, customizing, and supporting enterprise-grade CRM solutions.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">The ideal candidate should possess strong technical expertise in Dynamics 365 Customer Engagement (CE) / CRM platform, PL/SQL development, SSRS reporting, and enterprise application customization. The role requires close collaboration with business stakeholders, architects, and cross-functional technical teams to deliver scalable and high-performing CRM solutions.</p><hr><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Key Responsibilities and skills required</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM Development</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Design, develop, customize, and maintain Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM / CE applications.</li><li>Develop custom plugins, workflows, custom workflow activities, and integrations using C#, and .NET technologies.</li><li>Configure and customize Dynamics 365 modules including:<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\"><li>Sales</li><li>Customer Service</li><li>Marketing</li><li>Field Service (preferred)</li></ul></li><li>Develop client-side customizations using JavaScript, TypeScript, HTML, and CSS.</li><li>Participate in technical design discussions and provide scalable solution recommendations.</li><li>Troubleshoot and resolve production issues, performance bottlenecks, and integration challenges.</li></ul><hr><p><br> </p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"> </p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Mandatory Technical Skills</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><i>Dynamics 365 / Microsoft Technologies</i></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Strong hands-on experience with:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM / CE</li><li>C#</li><li>.NET Framework / .NET Core</li><li>REST APIs</li><li>Dataverse</li><li>CRM customization and configuration</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience with:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Plugins</li><li>Workflows</li><li>Business Rules</li><li>Ribbon customizations</li><li>Solution management</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><i>PL/SQL &amp; Database Skills</i></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Strong experience in Oracle PL/SQL development.</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Stored Procedures</li><li>Packages</li><li>Functions</li><li>Triggers</li><li>Complex SQL queries</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><i>Reporting Skills</i></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Strong experience in developing and supporting:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>SSRS Reports</li><li>Data-driven reports</li><li>SQL-based reporting solutions</li></ul><hr><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Preferred / Nice-to-Have Skills</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience with Azure Integration Services such as:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Azure Functions</li><li>Logic Apps</li><li>Azure Service Bus</li><li>Azure API Management</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience with Microsoft Power Platform:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Power Apps</li><li>Power Automate</li><li>Power BI</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Microsoft certifications in Dynamics 365, Power Platform, or Azure technologies.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience working in Agile/Scrum delivery environments.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Exposure to enterprise-scale CRM transformation or support programs.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience in application security and performance optimization.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience with multi-region or global CRM implementations.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Experience with Dynamics 365 Customer Insights or Copilot capabilities.</p><hr><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Soft Skills</strong></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</li><li>Excellent communication and stakeholder management abilities.</li><li>Ability to work independently and collaboratively within distributed teams.</li><li>Strong ownership mindset and commitment to delivery excellence.</li></ul><hr><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: solid; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\">Education</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li>Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Engineering, or related field.</li></ul><p><strong>Ralliant Corporation Overview</strong></p><p>Ralliant, originally part of Fortive, now stands as a bold, independent public company driving innovation at the forefront of precision technology. With a global footprint and a legacy of excellence, we empower engineers to bring next-generation breakthroughs to life — faster, smarter, and more reliably. Our high-performance instruments, sensors, and subsystems fuel mission-critical advancements across industries, enabling real-world impact where it matters most. At Ralliant we're building the future, together with those driven to push boundaries, solve complex problems, and leave a lasting mark on the world.</p><p><strong>About Tektronix</strong></p><p>Tektronix, a wholly owned subsidiary of Ralliant Corporation, is a place where people are challenged to explore the boundaries of what’s possible, bringing the digital future one step closer every day. Through precision-engineered measurement solutions, we work with our customers to eliminate the barriers between inspiration and realization of world-changing technologies. We believe that cultivating a deeper sense of loyalty and belonging is key to how we attract and retain our best people. This reality inspires our Inclusion &amp; Diversity vision, We Are More Together, and guides our approach as we all work toward creating great places where our teams work and thrive. Realize your true potential at Tektronix – join us in revolutionizing a better tomorrow! </p><p>We Are an Equal Opportunity Employer. Ralliant Corporation and all Ralliant Companies are proud to be equal opportunity employers. We value and encourage diversity and solicit applications from all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, age, marital status, disability, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or other characteristics protected by law. Ralliant and all Ralliant Companies are also committed to providing reasonable accommodations for applicants with disabilities. Individuals who need a reasonable accommodation because of a disability for any part of the employment application process, please contact us at applyassistance@Ralliant.com. </p><p><strong>Bonus or Equity</strong><br>This position is also eligible for bonus as part of the total compensation package.</p>",
